From {{inh|ru|orv|сꙋка}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*suka}} (compare Polish {{m|pl|suka}}), ultimately from a derivative of {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}.

